        "name": "Despite indictments in March 2018, the Iranian threat group is likely responsible for a large-scale campaign that targeted university credentials using the same spoofing tactics as previous attacks. In August 2018, members of university communities worldwide may have been providing access to more than just homework assignments. Secureworks Counter Threat Unit (CTU) researchers discovered a URL spoofing a login page for a university.",
