      {
        "lead_id": "activity-lead--etda--22f20e49ce8ba2781760",
        "name": "In July and August 2019, CTU researchers discovered a new large global phishing operation launched by COBALT DICKENS. This operation is similar to the threat group’s August 2018 campaign, using compromised university resources to send library-themed phishing emails.",
        "first_observed": {
